Z||000000||lowfunds||01-02-2001||01:57 PM||||First of all to anyone who is thinking of buying a body kit from them I would advise against it. I did not purchase the kit itself but sent for the tape and written instructions. WHAT A JOKE!!!! 30 bucks later I get a poorly made tape that has nothing to do with the conversion.( music and a tour of the shop) and copied instructions that I could not even read. I tried to contact them several times to remedy the situition, but no response. I am just posting this to keep others from getting screwed, If this has just happend to me,then I am sorry for saying anything, but just by the way they do buisness I think it has and will happen to many more. Just passing on personal experence, feel free to make your own judjment. ||||reg||1
